# NOTE: server/model/artifacts/ is deliberately NOT ignored -- the --lite
# artifacts (~3.7MB) are committed so a deploy needs nothing but `pip install`.
# Regenerate them with `python model/train_model.py --lite`.
#
# A full-fidelity run (`python model/train_model.py`) overwrites them with
# ~54MB of pickles that must not be committed. Git cannot tell the two apart
# -- same filenames -- so check `git status` before committing after training.